WEBVTT

00:01:42.100 --> 00:01:46.150
It's been only a few days
since ringing in the new year...

00:01:46.770 --> 00:01:51.120
...but the young people are
gradually losing their minds.

00:01:53.270 --> 00:01:56.340
Sine! Cosine! Tangent!
Square root of 2 = 1.4141356

00:01:56.940 --> 00:01:59.210
Kamakura Era
started - 1 192!

00:01:59.610 --> 00:02:02.830
Sir! Sir! What's
wrong with you? Hey!

00:02:04.610 --> 00:02:06.010
What could
be the problem?

00:02:09.610 --> 00:02:12.810
I see. The public university
qualifying exams start tomorrow.

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:14.690
Here you go, Miss.

00:02:16.290 --> 00:02:16.810
Thank you.

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.370
Sir!

00:02:47.990 --> 00:02:49.620
It's hard being a
student these days.

00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:51.770
I'd better be
extra nice to Godai'.

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:55.930
He must be nervous, now that
his studying's almost over.

00:02:59.330 --> 00:03:00.020
It's weird!

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.310
And ugly!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:15.420
The qualifying test
finally comes tomorrow.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.750
Think you're ready?

00:03:18.020 --> 00:03:19.940
Idiot! Why d'you
think I'm worried?

00:03:20.340 --> 00:03:21.340
Hopeless...

00:03:21.680 --> 00:03:25.110
I wish I'd been serious
about studying this past year.

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:29.640
I haven't
done a thing...

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.020
Y-You didn't
even start?

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.940
We haven't
even held hands.

00:03:37.690 --> 00:03:39.840
J-Just what are
you talking about?

00:03:40.360 --> 00:03:43.400
''What?'' My manager,
of course!

00:03:43.710 --> 00:03:46.310
And the fact that
we haven't done...

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.290
What i's he
thinking?

00:03:49.370 --> 00:03:51.590
Another rival
bites the dust.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:10.460
That's right!

00:04:10.740 --> 00:04:15.040
I have to warn Mr. Yotsuya and
Akemi' not to bother Godai'.

00:04:20.400 --> 00:04:22.140
'S cold.

00:04:29.760 --> 00:04:31.460
Okay! I'll
start with Akemi.

00:04:36.090 --> 00:04:38.320
Akemi?
Akemi?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.000
Godai!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.160
You want somethin'?

00:04:47.440 --> 00:04:48.260
Nothing!

00:04:49.440 --> 00:04:52.090
Hey!
What's the problem?

00:04:52.440 --> 00:04:54.460
I-I said
it's nothing!

00:04:57.120 --> 00:04:58.960
Manager?
What's wrong?

00:04:59.120 --> 00:05:01.190
N-Nothing, go
to your room.

00:05:03.120 --> 00:05:04.960
Really, what's
your problem?

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:08.500
Nothing at all!
Godai, hurry!

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:14.400
Hey! Manager!
What's wrong with you?

00:05:22.140 --> 00:05:23.510
I'm cold!

00:05:24.140 --> 00:05:25.770
I imagine
you would be.

00:05:28.480 --> 00:05:29.670
What're you
lookin' at?

00:05:32.480 --> 00:05:35.210
That's how you fail your
exams for the second year.

00:05:36.820 --> 00:05:37.960
Akemi!

00:05:40.480 --> 00:05:41.690
Two-time loser!

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:42.730
Akemi!

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:46.020
Okay, Manager,
what did you want?

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:47.820
It's too late.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:51.790
Godai will take his
qualifying exam tomorrow.

00:05:52.160 --> 00:05:59.500
I wanted to ask you not to bother
him, or walk around in negligees.

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.760
But it's too
late now...

00:06:03.840 --> 00:06:05.310
Hey!
Quit your peeping!

00:06:16.190 --> 00:06:17.920
Mr. Yotsuya?
Mr. Yotsuya?

00:06:20.870 --> 00:06:22.170
Maybe he's gone out...

00:06:23.540 --> 00:06:25.900
Mr. Yotsuya?
Aren't you home?

00:06:26.870 --> 00:06:27.510
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:06:28.870 --> 00:06:33.210
Really? Mr. Yotsuya is out?
A light in the darkness.

00:06:34.210 --> 00:06:36.290
Time for the
critical review!

00:06:49.560 --> 00:06:50.660
Guess who?

00:06:50.890 --> 00:06:52.860
Yotsuya!
It's Mr. Yotsuya!

00:06:53.230 --> 00:06:57.210
Precisely!
But however did you know?

00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:01.660
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:03.040
So here you are...

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:05.640
When did you come in?
How did you get in?

00:07:05.900 --> 00:07:07.810
I've been
here all along.

00:07:08.250 --> 00:07:11.290
As to my
point of entrance...

00:07:13.250 --> 00:07:14.230
Secret

00:07:16.910 --> 00:07:18.400
Y-You made
another hole!

00:07:18.910 --> 00:07:21.520
As you can see,
my ways are secret.

00:07:21.920 --> 00:07:23.980
There's nothing
''secret'' about it!

00:07:24.260 --> 00:07:25.960
In any case,
leave at once!

00:07:26.270 --> 00:07:27.190
Of course!

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.980
You're a cold man
Yusaku Godai.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:31.670
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:07:32.610 --> 00:07:35.730
Today is crucial for
Godai's studies!

00:07:36.610 --> 00:07:38.070
No more practical jokes!

00:07:39.610 --> 00:07:41.690
T-The manager is
sticking up for me!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:44.730
Now I can't fail!

00:07:51.620 --> 00:07:53.260
I'm home!

00:08:05.290 --> 00:08:07.400
I'm finally
into my studies!

00:08:10.310 --> 00:08:11.410
What's going on?

00:08:12.310 --> 00:08:14.590
Get down!
Look out!

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.040
Gotcha.

00:08:22.980 --> 00:08:23.750
You brat!

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:26.650
You didn't hafta
hit me!

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:28.290
Kids should
play outside!

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:31.320
But this hallway's so Flat
it rates an ''F '' Grade!

00:08:36.340 --> 00:08:38.480
''F-F- - F Grade''?

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.420
Y-You should
never say that!

00:08:53.340 --> 00:08:54.020
''Gotcha. ''

00:08:59.020 --> 00:09:02.040
Ma! Ma!
The ronin hit me!

00:09:02.690 --> 00:09:03.480
Really?

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.130
''Really''?

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:12.420
ls that all
you can say?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:14.300
Grin and bear it.

00:09:15.710 --> 00:09:17.460
''Grin and
bear it, Shiruo! ''

00:09:18.040 --> 00:09:18.770
''Menko!. ''

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:22.570
He's just nervous
about his test tomorrow.

00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:26.070
A ronin can get
away with anything?

00:09:26.710 --> 00:09:29.560
You'd just let him
hit a cute kid like me?

00:09:30.060 --> 00:09:33.570
Quit it! Pay him back
double when the test's over!

00:09:35.380 --> 00:09:38.250
''Wait for me until I've
passed my test, Menko! ''

00:09:38.730 --> 00:09:39.520
''Shiruo!. ''

00:09:41.390 --> 00:09:43.120
I can't wait
that long!

00:09:48.070 --> 00:09:50.940
No fair! Why does the world
give ronins all the breaks?

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:53.460
What's wrong with
skating in the hall?

00:09:53.750 --> 00:09:55.800
It's no fun
without an ''F '' Grade.

00:09:59.750 --> 00:10:02.230
Hey! Say something!
Jeez!

00:10:05.090 --> 00:10:06.980
What's wrong
with an ''F '' Grade!?

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:13.090
''F '' Grade! ''F '' Grade!
I wanna ''F '' Grade!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:17.920
I wanna ''F '' Grade!
I wanna ''F '' Grade!

00:10:18.090 --> 00:10:19.710
Kentaro!
Stop that!

00:10:20.770 --> 00:10:21.530
Why?

00:10:21.770 --> 00:10:23.000
Come on inside.

00:10:23.440 --> 00:10:24.340
Don't wanna!

00:10:24.440 --> 00:10:25.480
Come in!

00:10:44.690 --> 00:10:46.790
A winter's rain?

00:10:50.350 --> 00:10:52.970
I hope it's not a sign
of future tears.

00:11:21.380 --> 00:11:23.990
Now I'll make up for my
bad luck this afternoon!

00:11:34.730 --> 00:11:35.930
Godai...

00:11:44.410 --> 00:11:46.550
Don't turn my room
into your party hall!

00:11:47.080 --> 00:11:49.360
Can't help it.
It already is.

00:11:50.410 --> 00:11:52.050
What is this?
What is this?

00:11:53.080 --> 00:11:54.180
Ma! Ma!

00:11:55.080 --> 00:11:58.510
You said that we shouldn't bug
the ronin before his tests.

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:03.370
No sweat. He's conditioned so
if he hears a party, he studies.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:07.160
I am not!

00:12:08.100 --> 00:12:11.280
Tomorrow is certain
to be a depressing day.

00:12:12.100 --> 00:12:14.430
We gotta party
and forget!

00:12:19.780 --> 00:12:21.030
Are you guys
at it again?

00:12:35.120 --> 00:12:38.180
I will remind you again.
This is the examination season.

00:12:38.460 --> 00:12:41.140
Please leave
Godai alone.

00:12:42.470 --> 00:12:46.390
Please don't say ''Slip up, ''
''Take a fall, '' or ''Two-time loser. ''

00:12:47.140 --> 00:12:48.840
Not even as a joke.

00:12:51.800 --> 00:12:53.130
What shouldn't we say?

00:12:53.140 --> 00:12:53.990
''What''?

00:12:55.480 --> 00:12:57.380
Repeat it slightly
louder, please.

00:12:58.140 --> 00:13:00.260
''Slip up, '' ''Take a fall, ''
or ''Two-time loser. ''

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:04.840
''Slip up, '' ''Take a fall, ''
or ''Two-time loser, '' I said.

00:13:05.490 --> 00:13:10.120
Ah! ''Slip up, '' ''Take a fall, ''
or ''Two-time loser?'' Okay.

00:13:22.840 --> 00:13:24.510
Are you going out?

00:13:25.510 --> 00:13:28.090
I'll go study at a
friend's place tonight.

00:13:33.180 --> 00:13:33.760
Slip up!

00:13:41.510 --> 00:13:42.180
Take a fall!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.330
Isn't that fascinating?

00:13:56.530 --> 00:13:57.850
Mr. Yotsuya!

00:14:00.530 --> 00:14:02.050
FLY IN THIN AIR!

00:14:02.550 --> 00:14:03.860
WHO CAN DO THAT!?

00:14:06.220 --> 00:14:10.120
I see. I thought maybe
you could manage it.

00:14:10.890 --> 00:14:12.030
A pity.

00:14:12.890 --> 00:14:15.510
Jeez! Look at
this environment!

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:22.890
I-I broke my lace!
It's...

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:27.910
An omen.

00:14:28.570 --> 00:14:31.230
This isn't just bad luck.
It's a curse.

00:14:32.910 --> 00:14:34.840
Don't despair.
There's always next year.

00:14:35.580 --> 00:14:37.510
I can do without your
brand of ''comfort. ''

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:40.160
What's wrong?
It's true.

00:14:40.910 --> 00:14:43.160
And if next year's no good,
the year after that...

00:14:45.250 --> 00:14:48.880
People, if you don't cut this
out, I'll get really angry!

00:14:51.590 --> 00:14:52.730
W-What?

00:14:53.260 --> 00:14:55.010
She's too serious
about this.

00:14:55.260 --> 00:14:57.480
She's been acting odd
this afternoon.

00:14:58.600 --> 00:15:00.760
Got it! You got
a crush on the ronin.

00:15:03.260 --> 00:15:06.700
What are you saying? You
people never know when to stop!

00:15:07.610 --> 00:15:10.160
Changing the subject...
Shifting the blame... Lying...

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:12.730
Manager, you're blushing!

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:15.140
I'm just worried about
Godai's future...

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:16.960
We thought so!

00:15:17.620 --> 00:15:19.110
l...
l...

00:15:20.620 --> 00:15:22.230
Canceling your
evening plans?

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:23.050
Yes.

00:15:25.960 --> 00:15:26.750
Manager...

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:27.820
Yes?

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:31.410
I'll pass the test, in return
for all of your support.

00:15:31.970 --> 00:15:33.430
Y-You can do it!

00:15:39.980 --> 00:15:40.970
What was that?

00:15:41.980 --> 00:15:43.410
He's truly earnest.

00:15:43.980 --> 00:15:45.380
The life of a simpleton.

00:15:47.320 --> 00:15:48.430
I'm exhausted.

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:05.280
With the manager believing
in me, I can do it!

00:16:10.340 --> 00:16:12.120
This is a joke...right?

00:16:15.340 --> 00:16:16.410
Oh, no!
Oh, no!

00:16:18.350 --> 00:16:19.960
Hey, Manager!

00:16:21.350 --> 00:16:23.130
We're the only
building without power.

00:16:24.350 --> 00:16:26.130
That means a fuse blew.

00:16:27.360 --> 00:16:28.880
I'll help out, too.

00:16:29.360 --> 00:16:31.050
But your studies...

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:34.590
Can't study in the dark.

00:16:35.360 --> 00:16:36.660
That's true.

00:16:41.030 --> 00:16:45.510
That's odd, the fuses are all
fine. It could be the circuitry.

00:16:47.030 --> 00:16:49.930
If that's the case
according to the diagram...

00:16:50.380 --> 00:16:51.280
Can you fix it?

00:16:51.710 --> 00:16:55.630
Yes. I've got the tools, and
I know a little about wiring...

00:16:56.720 --> 00:16:57.760
It's up there, right?

00:16:58.390 --> 00:17:02.260
Yes. It's the first time
I've been in the attic, though.

00:17:15.740 --> 00:17:17.440
Alone in the
dark with her!

00:17:17.740 --> 00:17:19.570
- - Godai?
- - Y-Yes?

00:17:20.410 --> 00:17:22.660
These are the
clockworks, right?

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:25.930
Oh, for the
broken clock?

00:17:34.760 --> 00:17:37.750
it sort of smells like
an old library up here.

00:17:48.090 --> 00:17:50.240
It's just like
an antique store!

00:17:53.780 --> 00:17:56.970
I guess Maison Ikkoku's
been around for a long time.

00:17:58.110 --> 00:18:00.360
I wonder when
it was built?

00:18:16.470 --> 00:18:20.510
''Farewell Ikkoku, where I spent
my youth. March 13, 1940. ''

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:26.590
''Someday, we'll meet again.
October 17, 1944. ''

00:18:28.140 --> 00:18:29.360
That was
during the War.

00:19:06.180 --> 00:19:10.090
it must have been hard
to be in love in those days.

00:19:10.840 --> 00:19:11.640
Yeah...

00:19:12.510 --> 00:19:15.800
I wonder how many couples
were separated by war...

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:21.860
But we live in a
time of peace, Godai.

00:19:30.210 --> 00:19:34.070
Tenants who are no longer here,
and the memories of their youth...

00:19:35.530 --> 00:19:37.910
It's the history
of Maison Ikkoku.

00:19:38.210 --> 00:19:40.840
I could really come
to love this place.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:07.260
''To Sakura
from Ichiro. 1944. ''

00:20:09.570 --> 00:20:11.590
I wonder if it was
a forbidden love?

00:20:13.570 --> 00:20:16.230
I was lost in
the moment. I'm sorry.

00:20:16.920 --> 00:20:18.610
l-I'm sorry!
l-I'm sorry!

00:20:20.590 --> 00:20:21.410
Nothin'.

00:20:22.590 --> 00:20:24.070
Let's get
that wiring fixed.

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:25.050
Right.

00:20:31.930 --> 00:20:33.220
I have to do
my best on this.

00:20:33.940 --> 00:20:36.100
Your future is
riding on it.

00:20:37.260 --> 00:20:38.550
- - l...
- - Yes?

00:20:38.600 --> 00:20:41.530
I'm grateful that you're
so serious about me...

00:20:42.270 --> 00:20:42.920
No!

00:20:42.950 --> 00:20:46.260
You've got it wrong. I was
just thinking of your future...

00:20:48.610 --> 00:20:49.440
Thank you!

00:20:49.950 --> 00:20:52.000
- - Wait a second, Godai...
- - You've made me very happy.

00:20:52.610 --> 00:20:53.310
No... l...

00:21:01.300 --> 00:21:02.550
Hey! Manager!

00:21:03.970 --> 00:21:06.400
Manager! Manager!

00:21:33.320 --> 00:21:35.700
I thought it was
taking too long...

00:21:36.000 --> 00:21:39.160
Please don't mind us.
Pray continue.

00:21:40.000 --> 00:21:41.300
What do you mean?

00:21:49.340 --> 00:21:52.180
Soichiro, I'm sorry!
Soichiro!

00:21:53.680 --> 00:21:55.510
She's apologizing
to her dog.

00:21:56.340 --> 00:21:58.860
She hit her
head when she fell.

00:22:01.350 --> 00:22:03.230
It's a fried mouse!

00:22:06.350 --> 00:22:08.520
it was chewing
on the wires.

00:22:09.700 --> 00:22:10.860
I'll take care of it.

00:22:15.700 --> 00:22:16.930
It's fixed!

00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:18.940
Way to go, Manager!

00:22:32.050 --> 00:22:33.820
W-What is that sound?

00:22:35.050 --> 00:22:37.360
ls it not the
sound of the clock?

00:22:37.730 --> 00:22:39.750
But this
clock's busted.

00:22:43.400 --> 00:22:47.230
for some reason, the ''broken ''
clock suddenly started ringing.

00:22:50.730 --> 00:22:55.160
The ghastly bell resounded through
the rain-drenched town all night.

00:23:02.750 --> 00:23:06.090
Since I was up all night
anyway, I'll see you off.

00:23:06.760 --> 00:23:09.090
We'll cheer you
up with a party.

00:23:09.760 --> 00:23:11.510
Do only what you can.

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:14.030
You can do it!

00:23:15.090 --> 00:23:16.550
Okay, I'll see you.

00:23:26.100 --> 00:23:29.060
That was an
impressive slip-up.

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:32.230
He'll never pass.

00:23:46.130 --> 00:23:46.820
Took a fall.

00:23:50.800 --> 00:23:53.980
For a month, I've been saying,
''Godai! You can do it! ''

00:23:54.800 --> 00:23:57.670
But he just can't seem
to be able to pass a test.

00:23:58.140 --> 00:24:01.560
Next:. ''Kyoko's Heart Goes Pitty-Pat!
Godai Is Put to the Test. ''

00:24:02.480 --> 00:24:04.730
What!? You snuck out in
the middle of the exam!?

00:24:04.800 --> 00:24:06.680
I'll go with you to
the exam site tomorrow!
